 805:Source/render/decoders/jpeg.c **** /* Turn stored DC coefficients into a downscaled grayscale grid.
 806:Source/render/decoders/jpeg.c ****  * MCU-row scratch: blocks within one MCU row write different py rows, so
 807:Source/render/decoders/jpeg.c ****  * fill an (sMaxV*8) x rowW scratch per MCU row, then feed each source row
